msgid "It runs in your web browser, so there is nothing to install. The screen looks like a classic desktop with windows, a taskbar and a Start menu, and the chat works like mIRC."
msgstr "It runs in your web browser, so there is nothing to install. The screen looks like a classic desktop with windows, a taskbar and a Start menu, and the chat works like mIRC."

